<p class="x_x_MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:11.0pt">Hi there Sam,&nbsp;&nbsp; I hope you are doing well,</span></p>
<p class="x_x_MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:11.0pt">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="x_x_MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:11.0pt">Honeyman is indeed an Dune Access campground from October 1st to April 30<sup>th</sup>, we end up shutting the access down after April 30<sup>th</sup> to begin our Summer Camping Season.&nbsp; I currently have
 a welcome center position open for February, and the campsite that comes with it would be directly across from the ATV Access gate.&nbsp; If you are interested in the February position I would love to discuss it more with you on Monday when I return from my days
 off.&nbsp; Would 11:30AM on Monday the 6<sup>th</sup> be a good time to try and give you a call?</span></p>
<p class="x_x_MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:11.0pt">&nbsp;</span></p>
